--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Verdict
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  INVARIANT HOLDS. 5 transactions carried one idempotency key; exactly one committed, 4 were
  rejected with AlreadyCommitted, and the business instruction ran once.
  The attempts landed across 2 slots rather than one, so this run shows contention on a live
  cluster but NOT the same-slot case. Re-run for a tighter race, or read the LiteSVM test
  for the same-slot proof.

